=== (B) rank of the irreducible O(kappa) bracket matrix on backgrounds (L^3 torus) ===
 vacuum / homogeneous isotropic (A_c const, no current)         rank     0 / 864  -> second-class per site 0.000, dof per site = 2 + 0.000
 density modulation along x (A_c(x) varies), no current         rank   432 / 864  -> second-class per site 2.000, dof per site = 2 + 1.000
 generic inhomogeneous A_c(x), no current                       rank   432 / 864  -> second-class per site 2.000, dof per site = 2 + 1.000
 homogeneous beam along x (rotation-anomaly current), A const   rank   384 / 864  -> second-class per site 1.778, dof per site = 2 + 0.889
 beam + generic inhomogeneous A_c(x)                            rank   816 / 864  -> second-class per site 3.778, dof per site = 2 + 1.889
 (dof per site = (12 - 2*(#first class) - #second class)/2 = 2 + rank/(2N); no secondary constraints
  arise where the pairing is invertible, the multipliers n(x) and v.N(x) are fixed instead)

